test/check/error-alternatives.sumspec:6:15:
  |
6 | __init :: App(Page.{Home | Logs} * Link.On)
  |               ^
the initial state is one state, so it has no alternatives; pick one variant

test/check/error-alternatives.sumspec:10:19:
   |
10 | Link = On | Off | Lost
   |                   ^
warning: Link.Lost is never reached: neither __init nor any transition that can happen puts the app there

test/check/error-alternatives.sumspec:14:31:
   |
14 | target :: App => Page.Home -> Page.{Logs | Plan}
   |                               ^
a target sets one state, so it has no alternatives; pick one variant

test/check/error-alternatives.sumspec:15:7:
   |
15 | input Page.{Home | Logs} :: App => Link.On -> Link.Off
   |       ^
an input is one value, so it has no alternatives; pick one variant

test/check/error-alternatives.sumspec:16:37:
   |
16 | twice :: App => Page.{Home | Logs | Home} -> Page.Plan
   |                                     ^
Page.Home is written twice in these alternatives

test/check/error-alternatives.sumspec:17:29:
   |
17 | bound :: App => Mode.{Edit(#t) | View} -> Mode.View
   |                             ^
an alternative binds no value, since the other alternatives don't have it; write a transition for it, or name the value outside the alternatives

test/check/error-alternatives.sumspec:18:32:
   |
18 | unknown :: App => Page.{Home | Nope} -> Page.Plan
   |                                ^
Nope is not a variant of Page

test/check/error-alternatives.sumspec:19:25:
   |
19 | notsum :: App => Label.{A | B} -> Page.Plan
   |                         ^
Label has no variants, so .A is invalid

test/check/error-alternatives.sumspec:19:29:
   |
19 | notsum :: App => Label.{A | B} -> Page.Plan
   |                             ^
Label has no variants, so .B is invalid

test/check/error-alternatives.sumspec:21:27:
   |
21 | dead :: App => Link.{On | Lost} -> Link.Off
   |                           ^
warning: dead: this transition can never happen: its source needs Link.Lost, which is never reached

